 "notes": {
  "row0": {
   "x": 0,
   "y": 70,
   "text": "01  Foundations",
   "kind": "title1",
   "maxW": 4480
  },
  "row1": {
   "x": 0,
   "y": 210,
   "text": "Tokens, type, glass, motion and iconography. Everything else is built only from what is on these boards.",
   "size": "m",
   "w": 1400,
   "color": "gray"
  },
  "row2": {
   "x": 0,
   "y": 3025,
   "text": "02  Components",
   "kind": "title1",
   "maxW": 7520
  },
  "row3": {
   "x": 0,
   "y": 3165,
   "text": "Every part with every state, dark and light. Frames are the real components, so what you see here is what the screens use.",
   "size": "m",
   "w": 1400,
   "color": "gray"
  },
  "row4": {
   "x": 0,
   "y": 20247,
   "text": "04a  Onboarding",
   "kind": "title1",
   "maxW": 5360
  },
  "row5": {
   "x": 0,
   "y": 20387,
   "text": "S01 to S07. First run: welcome, home airport, scenarios, map style, three permission warm-ups, optional account, ready for take-off. S01 also shown in Turkish to test copy length. L01 sets the four Turkish deck strings in real components next to English and a German length test.",
   "size": "m",
   "w": 1400,
   "color": "gray"
  },
  "row6": {
   "x": 0,
   "y": 23508,
   "text": "04b  Plan, check in and board",
   "kind": "title1",
   "maxW": 5360
  },
  "row7": {
   "x": 0,
   "y": 23648,
   "text": "S10 to S15. Choose where the time takes you, check in, watch the pass print, tear the stub, and leave the ground.",
   "size": "m",
   "w": 1400,
   "color": "gray"
  },
  "row8": {
   "x": 0,
   "y": 27538,
   "text": "04c  Wallet, cards, passport and stats",
   "kind": "title1",
   "maxW": 5360
  },
  "row9": {
   "x": 0,
   "y": 27678,
   "text": "S30 to S37. The collection: tickets, membership cards, passport, world map, stats, and your year in flight.",
   "size": "m",
   "w": 1400,
   "color": "gray"
  },
  "row10": {
   "x": 0,
